			"id":"e1cb4814fed6a24b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Room Info\n\nArea outside the Mansion, has a number lock where the password is in a photo in the [[Dark Room.canvas|Dark Room]] when viewed with the Magnifier Item\n\nHas a valve that can be turned to enable one of the four fires in the [[Blue Fire Puzzle.canvas|Blue Fire Puzzle]]\n\nThe password is 1128\n\nHas the [[Gardener's Logbook.canvas|Gardener's Logbook]].",
